      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The cost of being right"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The October 29 exploit adds a second layer of uncertainty"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Macro timing made the entry harder to defend"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What would change the conclusion?"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The better outcome was no position"
      },
      {
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Sources and methodology"
      }
