        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Commercial products change the discussion. September's reported active ARR was up 10.6% month over month and roughly 86% during the third quarter. Pyth reported more than 3,811 Pyth Pro symbols, 61 continuous indices, and 129,265 monthly active Pyth Terminal users, with Terminal usage up 44.1% month over month. The July change putting existing Pyth Core API users onto paid plans beginning at $500 per month makes the commercialization effort more deliberate."
