        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The strongest evidence, then, is not a list of partnerships or a spectacular market-share claim. It is the appearance of recognizable product revenue and DAO receipts. Even here, discipline matters: the ARR and usage numbers are organizational disclosures, not audited financial statements. High growth from a small base can be real and still prove fragile."
